{"id":"21534fa207f091ee97a55233a65f7f542cae6861","axis":"silent","repo":"envoyproxy/envoy","sha":"21534fa207f091ee97a55233a65f7f542cae6861","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"api/envoy/extensions/filters/http/ai_protocol_manager/v3/ai_protocol_manager.proto","lines":["@@ -270,7 +270,7 @@ message RequestPerRoute {","   type.ai.v3.LLMProtocol llm_protocol = 1 [(validate.rules).enum = {defined_only: true}];"," ","   // How clients on this route carry ``llm_protocol`` on HTTP: the","-  // :ref:`binding <config_http_filters_ai_protocol_manager_transcoder_instructions>`","+  // :ref:`binding <config_http_ai_filters_transcoder_instructions>`","   // the transcoder reads the client's path and body under. When unset, the","   // client's path is read under the API's own binding and the bindings Envoy","   // defines for it, so one route takes clients of the Anthropic API and of","@@ -289,7 +289,7 @@ message ResponsePerRoute {","   type.ai.v3.LLMProtocol llm_protocol = 1 [(validate.rules).enum = {defined_only: true}];"," ","   // How the backend carries its API on HTTP: the","-  // :ref:`binding <config_http_filters_ai_protocol_manager_transcoder_instructions>`","+  // :ref:`binding <config_http_ai_filters_transcoder_instructions>`","   // the transcoder renders the request's path from and applies to its body.","   // When unset, a request whose backend speaks the client's API leaves in the","   // binding it arrived in, and any other request in the backend API's own."],"additions":2,"deletions":2,"truncated":false},{"path":"api/envoy/extensions/http/ai_filters/model_router/v3/model_router.proto","lines":["@@ -21,7 +21,7 @@ option (xds.annotations.v3.file_status).work_in_progress = true;"," "," // [#protodoc-title: Model Router AI filter]"," // ModelRouter AI filter :ref:`configuration overview","-// <config_http_filters_ai_protocol_manager_ai_filters>`.","+// <config_http_ai_filters_model_router>`."," // [#extension: envoy.http.ai_filters.model_router]"," "," // Represents an upstream LLM service provider or API endpoint host."],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"api/envoy/extensions/http/ai_filters/request_info/v3/request_info.proto","lines":["@@ -16,7 +16,7 @@ option (xds.annotations.v3.file_status).work_in_progress = true;"," "," // [#protodoc-title: Request info AI filter]"," // Request info AI filter :ref:`configuration overview","-// <config_http_filters_ai_protocol_manager_ai_filters>`.","+// <config_http_ai_filters_request_info>`."," // [#extension: envoy.http.ai_filters.request_info]"," "," // Publishes :ref:`RequestInfo <envoy_v3_api_msg_data.ai.v3.RequestInfo>` as typed"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"api/envoy/extensions/http/ai_filters/route_selector/v3/route_selector.proto","lines":["@@ -15,7 +15,7 @@ option (xds.annotations.v3.file_status).work_in_progress = true;"," "," // [#protodoc-title: Route Selector AI filter]"," // RouteSelector AI filter :ref:`configuration overview","-// <config_http_filters_ai_protocol_manager_ai_filters>`.","+// <config_http_ai_filters_route_selector>`."," // [#extension: envoy.http.ai_filters.route_selector]"," "," message RouteSelector {"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"api/envoy/extensions/http/ai_filters/schema_validation/v3/schema_validation.proto","lines":["@@ -18,7 +18,7 @@ option (xds.annotations.v3.file_status).work_in_progress = true;"," "," // [#protodoc-title: Schema validation AI filter]"," // Schema validation AI filter :ref:`configuration overview","-// <config_http_filters_ai_protocol_manager_schema_validation>`.","+// <config_http_ai_filters_schema_validation>`."," // [#extension: envoy.http.ai_filters.schema_validation]"," "," // Validates the request payload against the payload schema of its wire API, and rejects a payload"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"api/envoy/extensions/http/ai_filters/transcoder/v3/transcoder.proto","lines":["@@ -16,7 +16,7 @@ option (xds.annotations.v3.file_status).work_in_progress = true;"," "," // [#protodoc-title: Transcoder AI filter]"," // Transcoder AI filter :ref:`configuration overview","-// <config_http_filters_ai_protocol_manager_ai_filters>`.","+// <config_http_ai_filters_transcoder>`."," // [#extension: envoy.http.ai_filters.transcoder]"," "," // Rewrites an AI request or response payload from one vendor's API schema into another's, using"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"api/envoy/type/ai/v3/llm_binding.proto","lines":["@@ -54,7 +54,7 @@ message LLMBinding {","   reserved 2;"," ","   // The request path, as a :ref:`URI pattern","-  // <config_http_filters_ai_protocol_manager_transcoder_instructions>`: a two-way map between the","+  // <config_http_ai_filters_transcoder_instructions>`: a two-way map between the","   // path and the request's named values, each matching one path segment. ``{model}`` is the","   // request's model and the ``{unary|stream}`` choice its ``stream``, where the two sides differ in","   // the path; any other variable, such as ``{project}``, is a path variable, kept beside the body"],"additions":1,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/root/configuration/advanced/well_known_filter_state.rst","lines":["@@ -130,19 +130,19 @@ The following lists the filter state object keys used by the Envoy extensions to"," "," ``envoy.ai.llm_protocol.response``","   Names the backend's wire API to the :ref:`transcoder AI filter","-  <config_http_filters_ai_protocol_manager_transcoder_instructions>` and to response token-usage","+  <config_http_ai_filters_transcoder_instructions>` and to response token-usage","   extraction, ahead of the route's ``response`` declaration. Accepts an :ref:`LLMProtocol","   <envoy_v3_api_enum_type.ai.v3.LLMProtocol>` enum-value name as a constructor, e.g.","   \"GEMINI_GENERATE_CONTENT\". Supports field access with ``llm_protocol``."," "," ``envoy.ai.binding.request``","-  The :ref:`binding <config_http_filters_ai_protocol_manager_transcoder_instructions>` the","+  The :ref:`binding <config_http_ai_filters_transcoder_instructions>` the","   client's request arrived in, under which the transcoder's ``TO_IR`` leg reads its path and","   body. Accepts a URI pattern (``/...``) or an :ref:`LLMBinding","   <envoy_v3_api_msg_type.ai.v3.LLMBinding>` in JSON (``{...}``) as a constructor."," "," ``envoy.ai.binding.response``","-  The :ref:`binding <config_http_filters_ai_protocol_manager_transcoder_instructions>` the","+  The :ref:`binding <config_http_ai_filters_transcoder_instructions>` the","   backend expects, which the transcoder's ``FROM_IR`` leg renders into the request's ``:path``","   and applies to its body. Accepts a URI pattern or an :ref:`LLMBinding","   <envoy_v3_api_msg_type.ai.v3.LLMBinding>` in JSON as a constructor."],"additions":3,"deletions":3,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/root/configuration/http/ai_filters/_include/model-routing.yaml","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,113 @@","+static_resources:","+  listeners:","+  - name: listener_0","+    address:","+      socket_address:","+        address: 0.0.0.0","+        port_value: 10000","+    filter_chains:","+    - filters:","+      - name: envoy.filters.network.http_connection_manager","+        typed_config:","+          \"@type\": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.filters.network.http_connection_manager.v3.HttpConnectionManager","+          stat_prefix: ingress_http","+          route_config:","+            name: local_route","+            virtual_hosts:","+            - name: ai_gateway","+              domains:","+              - \"*\"","+              routes:","+              - match:","+                  path: \"/v1/chat/completions\"","+                route:","+                  cluster: openai","+                  retry_policy:","+                    retry_on: 5xx,connect-failure,reset,retriable-status-codes","+                    retriable_status_codes:","+                    - 429","+                    num_retries: 1","+                typed_per_filter_config:","+                  envoy.filters.http.ai_protocol_manager:","+                    \"@type\": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.filters.http.ai_protocol_manager.v3.AiProtocolManagerPerRoute","+                    request:","+                      llm_protocol: OPENAI_CHAT_COMPLETIONS","+          http_filters:","+          - name: envoy.filters.http.ai_protocol_manager","+            typed_config:","+              \"@type\": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.filters.http.ai_protocol_manager.v3.AiProtocolManager","+              request_handling: {}","+              filters:","+              - name: envoy.http.ai_filters.schema_validation","+                typed_config:","+                  \"@type\": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.http.ai_filters.schema_validation.v3.SchemaValidation","+              - name: envoy.http.ai_filters.request_info","+                typed_config:","+                  \"@type\": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.http.ai_filters.request_info.v3.RequestInfo","+              - name: envoy.http.ai_filters.model_router","+                typed_config:","+                  \"@type\": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.http.ai_filters.model_router.v3.ModelRouter","+                  providers:","+                  - name: openai","+                    llm_protocol: OPENAI_CHAT_COMPLETIONS","+                    host_and_port: api.openai.com","+                  models:","+                  - name: primary","+                    provider: openai","+                    model: gpt-4o","+                    api_key:","+                      inline_string: \"Bearer sk-example\"","+                  - name: fallback","+                    provider: openai","+                    model: gpt-4o-mini","+                    api_key:","+                      inline_string: \"Bearer sk-example\"","+                  routes:","+                  - requested_model: fast","+                    targets:","+                    - model: primary","+                    - model: fallback","+          - name: envoy.filters.http.router","+            typed_config:","+              \"@type\": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.filters.http.router.v3.Router","+              upstream_http_filters:","+              - name: envoy.filters.http.ai_protocol_manager","+                typed_config:","+                  \"@type\": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.filters.http.ai_protocol_manager.v3.AiProtocolManager","+                  request_handling: {}","+                  filters:","+                  - name: envoy.http.ai_filters.route_selector","+                    typed_config:","+                      \"@type\": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.http.ai_filters.route_selector.v3.RouteSelector","+                  - name: envoy.http.ai_filters.transcoder","+                    typed_config:","+                      \"@type\": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.http.ai_filters.transcoder.v3.Transcoder","+                      request_handling: TO_IR","+                      response_handling: FROM_IR","+                  - name: envoy.http.ai_filters.transcoder","+                    typed_config:","+                      \"@type\": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.http.ai_filters.transcoder.v3.Transcoder","+                      request_handling: FROM_IR","+                      response_handling: TO_IR","+              - name: envoy.filters.http.upstream_codec","+                typed_config:","+                  \"@type\": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.filters.http.upstream_codec.v3.UpstreamCodec","+","+  clusters:","+  - name: openai","+    type: LOGICAL_DNS","+    dns_lookup_family: V4_ONLY","+    load_assignment:","+      cluster_name: openai","+      endpoints:","+      - lb_endpoints:","+        - endpoint:","+            address:","+              socket_address:","+                address: api.openai.com","+                port_value: 443","+    transport_socket:","+      name: envoy.transport_sockets.tls","+      typed_config:","+        \"@type\": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.transport_sockets.tls.v3.UpstreamTlsContext","+        sni: api.openai.com"],"additions":113,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/root/configuration/http/ai_filters/_include/request-info.yaml","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,91 @@","+static_resources:","+  listeners:","+  - name: listener_0","+    address:","+      socket_address:","+        address: 0.0.0.0","+        port_value: 10000","+    filter_chains:","+    - filters:","+      - name: envoy.filters.network.http_connection_manager","+        typed_config:","+          \"@type\": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.filters.network.http_connection_manager.v3.HttpConnectionManager","+          stat_prefix: ingress_http","+          route_config:","+            name: local_route","+            virtual_hosts:","+            - name: ai_gateway","+              domains:","+              - \"*\"","+              routes:","+              - match:","+                  path: \"/v1/chat/completions\"","+                route:","+                  cluster: openai","+                typed_per_filter_config:","+                  envoy.filters.http.ai_protocol_manager:","+                    \"@type\": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.filters.http.ai_protocol_manager.v3.AiProtocolManagerPerRoute","+                    request:","+                      llm_protocol: OPENAI_CHAT_COMPLETIONS","+          http_filters:","+          - name: envoy.filters.http.ai_protocol_manager","+            typed_config:","+              \"@type\": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.filters.http.ai_protocol_manager.v3.AiProtocolManager","+              request_handling: {}","+              filters:","+              - name: envoy.http.ai_filters.request_info","+                typed_config:","+                  \"@type\": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.http.ai_filters.request_info.v3.RequestInfo","+                  token_estimation:","+                    tokens_per_byte: 0.5","+          - name: envoy.filters.http.ext_proc","+            typed_config:","+              \"@type\": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.filters.http.ext_proc.v3.ExternalProcessor","+              grpc_service:","+                envoy_grpc:","+                  cluster_name: ext_proc","+              processing_mode:","+                request_header_mode: SEND","+                response_header_mode: SKIP","+              metadata_options:","+                forwarding_namespaces:","+                  typed:","+                  - envoy.ai.request_info","+          - name: envoy.filters.http.router","+            typed_config:","+              \"@type\": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.filters.http.router.v3.Router","+","+  clusters:","+  - name: openai","+    type: LOGICAL_DNS","+    dns_lookup_family: V4_ONLY","+    load_assignment:","+      cluster_name: openai","+      endpoints:","+      - lb_endpoints:","+        - endpoint:","+            address:","+              socket_address:","+                address: api.openai.com","+                port_value: 443","+    transport_socket:","+      name: envoy.transport_sockets.tls","+      typed_config:","+        \"@type\": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.transport_sockets.tls.v3.UpstreamTlsContext","+        sni: api.openai.com","+  - name: ext_proc","+    type: STATIC","+    typed_extension_protocol_options:","+      envoy.extensions.upstreams.http.v3.HttpProtocolOptions:","+        \"@type\": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.upstreams.http.v3.HttpProtocolOptions","+        explicit_http_config:","+          http2_protocol_options: {}","+    load_assignment:","+      cluster_name: ext_proc","+      endpoints:","+      - lb_endpoints:","+        - endpoint:","+            address:","+              socket_address:","+                address: 127.0.0.1","+                port_value: 9000"],"additions":91,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/root/configuration/http/ai_filters/_include/transcoder.yaml","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,85 @@","+static_resources:","+  listeners:","+  - name: listener_0","+    address:","+      socket_address:","+        address: 0.0.0.0","+        port_value: 10000","+    filter_chains:","+    - filters:","+      - name: envoy.filters.network.http_connection_manager","+        typed_config:","+          \"@type\": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.filters.network.http_connection_manager.v3.HttpConnectionManager","+          stat_prefix: ingress_http","+          route_config:","+            name: local_route","+            virtual_hosts:","+            - name: ai_gateway","+              domains:","+              - \"*\"","+              routes:","+              - match:","+                  prefix: \"/anthropic/\"","+                route:","+                  cluster: claude_gateway","+                typed_per_filter_config:","+                  envoy.filters.http.ai_protocol_manager:","+                    \"@type\": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.filters.http.ai_protocol_manager.v3.AiProtocolManagerPerRoute","+                    request:","+                      llm_protocol: OPENAI_CHAT_COMPLETIONS","+                  envoy.filters.http.set_filter_state:","+                    \"@type\": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.filters.http.set_filter_state.v3.Config","+                    on_request_headers:","+                    - object_key: envoy.ai.llm_protocol.response","+                      format_string:","+                        text_format_source:","+                          inline_string: \"ANTHROPIC_MESSAGES\"","+                    - object_key: envoy.ai.binding.response","+                      format_string:","+                        text_format_source:","+                          inline_string: \"/gateway/anthropic/{model}/{messages|messages-stream}\"","+                    - object_key: envoy.ai.model.resolved","+                      format_string:","+                        text_format_source:","+                          inline_string: \"claude-sonnet-4-5\"","+          http_filters:","+          - name: envoy.filters.http.set_filter_state","+            typed_config:","+              \"@type\": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.filters.http.set_filter_state.v3.Config","+          - name: envoy.filters.http.ai_protocol_manager","+            typed_config:","+              \"@type\": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.filters.http.ai_protocol_manager.v3.AiProtocolManager","+              request_handling: {}","+              filters:","+              - name: envoy.http.ai_filters.transcoder","+                typed_config:","+                  \"@type\": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.http.ai_filters.transcoder.v3.Transcoder","+                  request_handling: TO_IR","+                  response_handling: FROM_IR","+              - name: envoy.http.ai_filters.transcoder","+                typed_config:","+                  \"@type\": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.http.ai_filters.transcoder.v3.Transcoder","+                  request_handling: FROM_IR","+                  response_handling: TO_IR","+          - name: envoy.filters.http.router","+            typed_config:","+              \"@type\": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.filters.http.router.v3.Router","+","+  clusters:","+  - name: claude_gateway","+    type: LOGICAL_DNS","+    dns_lookup_family: V4_ONLY","+    load_assignment:","+      cluster_name: claude_gateway","+      endpoints:","+      - lb_endpoints:","+        - endpoint:","+            address:","+              socket_address:","+                address: claude-gateway.example.com","+                port_value: 443","+    transport_socket:","+      name: envoy.transport_sockets.tls","+      typed_config:","+        \"@type\": type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.transport_sockets.tls.v3.UpstreamTlsContext","+        sni: claude-gateway.example.com"],"additions":85,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/root/configuration/http/ai_filters/ai_filters.rst","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,21 @@","+.. _config_http_ai_filters:","+","+AI filters","+==========","+","+AI filters (category ``envoy.http.ai_filters``) run inside the :ref:`AI Protocol","+Manager <config_http_filters_ai_protocol_manager>` over a request's parsed","+payload and, for some, its response. They are configured, in order, in its","+:ref:`filters","+<envoy_v3_api_field_extensions.filters.http.ai_protocol_manager.v3.AiProtocolManager.filters>`","+list; see :ref:`AI filters <config_http_filters_ai_protocol_manager_ai_filters>`","+for when they run.","+","+.. toctree::","+  :maxdepth: 2","+","+  model_router_filter","+  request_info_filter","+  route_selector_filter","+  schema_validation_filter","+  transcoder_filter"],"additions":21,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/root/configuration/http/ai_filters/model_router_filter.rst","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,72 @@","+.. _config_http_ai_filters_model_router:","+","+Model router","+============","+","+The model router AI filter maps the model a client asks for to an ordered list","+of upstream models, and stores them in the ``envoy.ai.routes`` filter state","+object for the :ref:`route selector <config_http_ai_filters_route_selector>` AI","+filter to apply on each upstream attempt. It reads the requested model from the","+``envoy.ai.model.request`` filter state object, which the :ref:`request info","+<config_http_ai_filters_request_info>` AI filter sets, so configure it after that","+filter: without request info ahead of it, every request is rejected with a","+``404``.","+","+* This AI filter should be configured with the type URL","+  ``type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.http.ai_filters.model_router.v3.ModelRouter``.","+* :ref:`v3 API reference <envoy_v3_api_msg_extensions.http.ai_filters.model_router.v3.ModelRouter>`","+","+Configuration","+-------------","+","+A :ref:`provider <envoy_v3_api_msg_extensions.http.ai_filters.model_router.v3.Provider>`","+names an upstream's wire API, its authority and, optionally, the :ref:`binding","+<config_http_ai_filters_transcoder_instructions>` it carries the API in. A","+:ref:`model <envoy_v3_api_msg_extensions.http.ai_filters.model_router.v3.Model>`","+names the provider hosting it, the model identifier sent upstream and,","+optionally, the credential to send with it. A :ref:`route","+<envoy_v3_api_msg_extensions.http.ai_filters.model_router.v3.RoutingEntry>` maps a","+requested model to candidate models: the first serves the first attempt, and","+each retry the next. All models in a route must have the same provider.","+","+The filter does not retry by itself. Falling back to the next candidate takes a","+:ref:`retry policy <envoy_v3_api_field_config.route.v3.RouteAction.retry_policy>`","+on the route, whose ``retry_on`` conditions decide which failures move on to the","+next candidate. The filter caps the retries with ``x-envoy-max-retries``, one","+less than the number of candidates, and, until the router reads the resolved","+candidates itself, sets the request's authority to the first candidate's provider.","+","+The model router is one half of a configuration: it runs in the downstream","+filter chain, and the route selector, which applies each candidate, in the","+router's upstream filter chain. In this configuration, a request for the model","+``fast`` is sent to ``gpt-4o``, and on a retryable failure to ``gpt-4o-mini``:","+","+.. literalinclude:: _include/model-routing.yaml","+    :language: yaml","+    :lines: 20-69","+    :lineno-start: 20","+    :emphasize-lines: 6-10, 28-50","+    :linenos:","+    :caption: :download:`model-routing.yaml <_include/model-routing.yaml>`","+","+The route selector sends the credential as the whole ``authorization`` header","+value, such as ``Bearer sk-...``, or as ``x-goog-api-key`` for a","+``GEMINI_GENERATE_CONTENT`` provider. A provider that only takes its key in","+another header, such as Anthropic's ``x-api-key``, cannot be authenticated this","+way.","+","+A request that names no model, or one no route lists, is rejected with a","+``404``.","+","+Statistics","+----------","+","+The filter outputs statistics in the ``ai_protocol_manager.model_router.`` namespace:","+","+.. csv-table::","+  :header: Name, Type, Description","+  :widths: 1, 1, 2","+","+  success, Counter, The requested model matched a route and its candidates were stored in filter state.","+  model_name_missing, Counter, \"The request named no model, or no ``envoy.ai.model.request`` object was set, and it was rejected with a ``404``.\"","+  route_not_found, Counter, No route matched the requested model and the request was rejected with a ``404``."],"additions":72,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/root/configuration/http/ai_filters/request_info_filter.rst","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,104 @@","+.. _config_http_ai_filters_request_info:","+","+Request info","+============","+","+The request info AI filter publishes the requested model, streaming preference,","+output token cap, and message and tool counts as :ref:`envoy.data.ai.v3.RequestInfo","+<envoy_v3_api_msg_data.ai.v3.RequestInfo>` typed dynamic metadata, under","+``envoy.ai.request_info`` by default. It never modifies or rejects the request.","+","+* This AI filter should be configured with the type URL","+  ``type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.http.ai_filters.request_info.v3.RequestInfo``.","+* :ref:`v3 API reference <envoy_v3_api_msg_extensions.http.ai_filters.request_info.v3.RequestInfo>`","+","+Configuration","+-------------","+","+.. literalinclude:: _include/request-info.yaml","+    :language: yaml","+    :lines: 31-40","+    :lineno-start: 31","+    :emphasize-lines: 6-8","+    :linenos:","+    :caption: :download:`request-info.yaml <_include/request-info.yaml>`","+","+Attributes are read according to the request's wire API: the one it declares,","+or the one the :ref:`schema validation","+<config_http_ai_filters_schema_validation>` filter resolved","+when it runs first:","+","+.. csv-table::","+  :header: Attribute, OpenAI Chat Completions, OpenAI Responses, Anthropic Messages, Gemini","+  :widths: 1, 1, 1, 1, 1","+","+  ``model``, ``model``, ``model``, ``model``, model segment of the request path","+  ``stream``, ``stream``, ``stream``, ``stream``, \"``:generateContent`` (``false``) or ``:streamGenerateContent`` (``true``) operation in the request path\"","+  ``max_output_tokens``, \"``max_completion_tokens``, else ``max_tokens``\", ``max_output_tokens``, ``max_tokens``, \"``generationConfig.maxOutputTokens`` (camelCase or snake_case)\"","+  ``message_count``, ``messages``, \"``input`` (a string counts as one message)\", ``messages``, ``contents``","+  ``tool_count``, ``tools``, ``tools``, ``tools``, ``tools``","+","+Without an API, only ``model`` and ``stream`` are read. Every value is","+client-declared and optional. A value Envoy cannot use (wrong type, out of","+range, or a string over 256 bytes) is ignored and counted by","+``partial``.","+","+The record is written before the held request headers are released, so later","+decode filters see it from their first request-headers callback. An","+:ref:`ext_proc <config_http_filters_ext_proc>` filter listed after this one","+receives it through typed namespace forwarding:","+","+.. literalinclude:: _include/request-info.yaml","+    :language: yaml","+    :lines: 41-53","+    :lineno-start: 41","+    :emphasize-lines: 10-13","+    :linenos:","+    :caption: :download:`request-info.yaml <_include/request-info.yaml>`","+","+Only typed metadata is published. If the namespace already holds a record for","+the stream, the new one is skipped and counted by ``duplicate``.","+","+The model is also stored as the ``envoy.ai.model.request`` :ref:`filter state","+object <well_known_filter_state>`, a string, so filters, the router and access","+logs can read it without unpacking the record, e.g. with","+``%FILTER_STATE(envoy.ai.model.request:PLAIN)%``. Nothing is stored when the","+request names no usable model, and an object a filter ahead already set is","+kept.","+","+Token estimation","+----------------","+","+Configuring :ref:`token_estimation","+<envoy_v3_api_field_extensions.http.ai_filters.request_info.v3.RequestInfo.token_estimation>`","+adds ``estimated_input_tokens`` to the record, for consumers that must budget","+before the provider reports what it charged: a rate limit on tokens per minute,","+or a load balancer weighing queued work. It is ``ceil(tokens_per_byte *","+request payload bytes)`` over the body Envoy buffered, so it reads no JSON and","+is published whatever the route declares:","+","+.. literalinclude:: _include/request-info.yaml","+    :language: yaml","+    :lines: 36-40","+    :lineno-start: 36","+    :emphasize-lines: 4-5","+    :linenos:","+    :caption: :download:`request-info.yaml <_include/request-info.yaml>`","+","+The ratio is a property of the payloads a deployment sees, and a size heuristic","+is not a tokenizer: an estimate does not replace the :ref:`token usage","+<envoy_v3_api_msg_data.ai.v3.TokenUsage>` the response reports. Rounding up","+keeps a sub-token payload from estimating zero.","+","+Statistics","+----------","+","+The filter outputs statistics in the ``ai_protocol_manager.request_info.`` namespace:","+","+.. csv-table::","+  :header: Name, Type, Description","+  :widths: 1, 1, 2","+","+  published, Counter, The request info AI filter published an ``envoy.data.ai.v3.RequestInfo`` record.","+  partial, Counter, A published request info record ignored at least one value Envoy could not use.","+  duplicate, Counter, Request info publication skipped because another installation of the filter had already published the namespace for this stream."],"additions":104,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/root/configuration/http/ai_filters/route_selector_filter.rst","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,56 @@","+.. _config_http_ai_filters_route_selector:","+","+Route selector","+==============","+","+The route selector AI filter applies, on each upstream attempt, the candidate","+the :ref:`model router <config_http_ai_filters_model_router>` AI filter resolved","+for it: the first candidate on the first attempt, the second on the first retry,","+and so on. It sets the request's authority to the candidate's provider and","+leaves the candidate's wire API, model and binding as the","+``envoy.ai.llm_protocol.response``, ``envoy.ai.model.resolved`` and","+``envoy.ai.binding.response`` :ref:`transcoding instructions","+<config_http_ai_filters_transcoder_instructions>`.","+","+The filter always removes the client's ``authorization``, ``x-api-key`` and","+``x-goog-api-key`` headers, whether or not the candidate has a credential. It","+then sends the candidate's credential, if it has one, in ``authorization``","+(``x-goog-api-key`` for ``GEMINI_GENERATE_CONTENT``). A candidate without an","+:ref:`api_key <envoy_v3_api_field_extensions.http.ai_filters.model_router.v3.Model.api_key>`","+is sent upstream unauthenticated.","+","+* This AI filter should be configured with the type URL","+  ``type.googleapis.com/envoy.extensions.http.ai_filters.route_selector.v3.RouteSelector``."],"additions":23,"deletions":0,"truncated":false}],"additions":520,"deletions":11,"truncated":true,"file_count":15},"error":null,"fetched_at":"2026-11-25T18:25:06.157622+00:00"}